<title>UK: LME copper, aluminium head into PM rings firmer.</title>
<headline>LME copper, aluminium head into PM rings firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Rises nearly $10 in lunchtime inter-office trade, may test $2,440 resistance in PM rings.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Follows copper higher, heads for $1,600, but may run into trade selling.</p>
<p>OTHER METALS - Hold steady at end monring levels.</p>
